{"type":"standard","title":"Yongbei Zhuang","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Yongbei Zhuang</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q8054983","titles":{"canonical":"Yongbei_Zhuang","normalized":"Yongbei Zhuang","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Yongbei Zhuang</span></span>"},"pageid":35247671,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/42/Yongbei.png/330px-Yongbei.png","width":330,"height":233},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/42/Yongbei.png","width":3511,"height":2484},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1330718856","tid":"3128303b-e781-11f0-a9a9-b90c60716012","timestamp":"2026-01-02T02:17:31Z","description":"Zhuang variety of China","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yongbei_Zhuang","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yongbei_Zhuang?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yongbei_Zhuang?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Yongbei_Zhuang"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yongbei_Zhuang","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Yongbei_Zhuang","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yongbei_Zhuang?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Yongbei_Zhuang"}},"extract":"Yongbei Zhuang is a Zhuang variety including the dialects of Yongning North, Binyang, Hengxian, and Pingguo dialects. 'Yongbei' 邕北 is Chinese and here means North of the Yongjiang river; in other contexts it can stand for the north of Yongning County, or Yongning North.","extract_html":"<p><b>Yongbei Zhuang</b> is a Zhuang variety including the dialects of Yongning North, Binyang, Hengxian, and Pingguo dialects. 'Yongbei' 邕北 is Chinese and here means North of the Yongjiang river; in other contexts it can stand for the north of Yongning County, or Yongning North.</p>"}